    # hold a Windows file without FILE_SHARE_DELETE.  Replacement authority is
    # still bound to the retained parent handle and exact component, so retrying
    # only the two transient sharing statuses does not widen the path authority.
    # Keep the retry bounded: a persistent lock remains a hard failure.
